| Graham Campbell | 782 | 85.7% |
| Priscila Duarte | 118 | 12.9% |
| Vance Lucas | 10 | 1.1% |
| Jonas Staudenmeir | 1 | 0.1% |
| JT Smith | 1 | 0.1% |

