| File | Main author of current lines |
|---|---|
| `EntryParser.php` (363 lines) | Graham, 100% |
| `Value.php` (101 lines) | Graham, 100% |
| `Lines.php` (136 lines) | Graham, 92% |
| `Entry.php`, `Lexer.php`, `Parser.php`, `ParserInterface.php` | Graham, 98–100% |
| `Comments.php` (56 lines) | Priscila, 100% |
